      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COLOUR OF RED (2) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at Mandurah over 400m behind Six Story Syd (23.31) in a LS6. Key runner on his best form. GRANDAD KEVIN (8) has been hard to follow lately, running sixth (23.38) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Mandurah. Key player on best and worth another try. SHINBONER PIXIE (4) jumped from this box last time and placed in a Grade 5/6 at this track over 297m, finishing third (18.11). Has a very consistent record off this same box, including four wins and five placings from 16 starts. Has the ability and can measure up. GO LILO GO (1) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
